<title>USA: Carson City, Nev., $15 mln won by Prudential Sec.</title>
<headline>Carson City, Nev., $15 mln won by Prudential Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Sec. said it won $15 million of Carson City, Nev., general obligation limited tax public safety bonds, Series May 1, 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.63 percent.</p>
</text>
